        <section id="productive-feedback"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>Productive feedback</h2>
              <p>Select the images below to read about ways of giving productive feedback.</p>

              
              <!-- IF 2 --><ul class="l-icon-grid ">
  
  
    
    <!--  -->
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s2_p2_reveal1.svg" alt="Safety" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Safety</h3>
      <p>Add civility and safety into feedback approach – most people need to feel comfortable when receiving feedback for it to be productive.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s2_p2_reveal2.svg" alt="Positive" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Positive</h3>
      <p>Try to keep your feedback positive even when giving ‘negative or corrective’ feedback - follow ‘corrective’ feedback with a solution suggestion.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s2_p2_reveal3.svg" alt="Specific" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Specific</h3>
      <p>Try to be specific and positive rather than be too general as that could be interpreted in different ways depending on the persons point of view.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s2_p2_reveal4.svg" alt="Immediate" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Immediate</h3>
      <p>Give feedback frequently and at the same time as for the action it is needed.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
  
</ul>

            
          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
  
